{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 2,
  "name": {
    "ja": "下水道",
    "en": "The Sewer",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 15,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "街の地下の下水道の様子が最近おかしいです。この素晴らしい",
          "街の地下に怪物が棲んでいると言う噂が流れています。どうか",
          "害虫どもを駆除し、下水道を（汚くても）もとの状態に",
          "戻して下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The sewer underneath the city has been acting strange",
          "lately. There are rumors of monsters living beneath our",
          "fair city. I need you to exterminate the vermin and",
          "bring the sewer back to its normal, if dirty, self.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["お見事です。お礼を外に用意しておきました。"],
        "en": ["A reward for your good work awaits you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "あなたが下水道を一掃するのに失敗したので、",
          "地元のドルイド教会に応援を頼む羽目になりましたよ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "I had to call help from a local druid, since you failed to",
          "clean out the sewer.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
